{
  "name": "Full Freight Quoting System - Inquiry to Invoice",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - READ THE INQUIRY AND PULL THE SHIPMENT DETAILS\n\nClaude reads the inbound email and fills a fixed shipment schema. Anything missing goes back to the client before the lane is worked.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 1240,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "1d22194b-299a-5e79-b8f9-f256f835bce3",
      "name": "Section - 1 - READ THE INQUIRY AND PULL THE SHIPMENT DETAILS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - SOURCE RATES FROM THE AGENT NETWORK\n\nOne rate request per country, sent from Outlook. The workflow holds the lane open for a day and then collects whatever came back.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e70c2217-7d07-594d-9fab-41f27ece30db",
      "name": "Section - 2 - SOURCE RATES FROM THE AGENT NETWORK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - COMPARE, NEGOTIATE, GET HUMAN APPROVAL\n\nRates arrive in different currencies and units. Claude normalizes them, and no quote leaves without a person approving the number.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "9aecd4b3-81ed-5ca2-a0d3-982b8863656e",
      "name": "Section - 3 - COMPARE, NEGOTIATE, GET HUMAN APPROVAL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2500,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - QUOTE THE CLIENT AND FOLLOW UP\n\nThe quote is written from your template and terms, then chased on a timer until the client answers.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 1280,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "a8852d13-d389-5e37-90da-c21fb2e9a13f",
      "name": "Section - 4 - QUOTE THE CLIENT AND FOLLOW UP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3600,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - INVOICE, ARCHIVE, CATCH FAILURES\n\nAccepted quotes become a Wafeq invoice. Every quote is archived and every outcome is logged, win or lose.",
        "height": 800,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "b36bccc4-7975-548b-9161-283c119114aa",
      "name": "Section - 5 - INVOICE, ARCHIVE, CATCH FAILURES",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5040,
        -120
      ]
    },
